                "severity": "SUGGESTION",
                "claim": "The six grouping dimensions are tied together only by position. The groups array, the keys array in Add and the outputs slice in Report must stay in the same order, and a trailing comment is the only link. Named index constants would prevent silent misassignment on reorder.",
